---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../consts';
---

<PageLayout
  title="Disclaimer"
  description="Honest Picture is educational and informational only. It is not medical, psychological, financial, or legal advice, and it does not provide crisis support."
  path="/disclaimer"
  eyebrow="Trust & Legal"
  heading="Disclaimer"
  lede="Educational and informational only. Please read this before relying on anything here."
  updated="July 2026"
  showDisclaimer={false}
>
  <h2>Not professional advice</h2>
  <p>
    {SITE.name} presents publicly available research, government data, and
    peer-reviewed studies to help people understand their lives in honest context.
    All content and tools are for <strong>general educational and informational
    purposes only</strong>. Nothing on this site is professional advice, and using
    the site does not create any professional relationship. In particular:
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <strong>Not medical or mental-health advice.</strong> Content about health,
      sleep, stress, mood, or emotions is not a diagnosis, treatment, or substitute
      for care from a qualified clinician. Consult a professional about any symptom
      or condition, and never disregard or delay professional advice because of
      something you read here.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Not financial advice.</strong> Content about money, saving, debt, or
      retirement is general information, not personalised financial, investment, or
      tax advice. Speak with a qualified adviser before making financial decisions.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Not legal advice.</strong> Nothing here is legal advice or a
      substitute for consulting a licensed professional in your jurisdiction.
    </li>
  </ul>

  <h2>If you are struggling</h2>
  <p>
    If you are experiencing a mental-health crisis, or having thoughts of harming
    yourself, please contact a qualified professional or a crisis service right
    away. This website cannot and does not provide crisis support.
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>United States:</strong> call or text <strong>988</strong> for the Suicide and Crisis Lifeline, available 24/7.</li>
    <li><strong>United Kingdom &amp; Ireland:</strong> call Samaritans on <strong>116 123</strong>.</li>
    <li><strong>Canada:</strong> call or text <strong>988</strong>.</li>
    <li><strong>Elsewhere:</strong> please search for your local crisis line or emergency number, or contact your local emergency services.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>About the data</h2>
  <p>We cite real sources and aim for accuracy, but:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Figures are often <strong>rounded and approximate</strong>, and are presented to show the shape of a distribution, not to measure your individual life precisely.</li>
    <li>Most population data is strongest for the United States and other high-income countries, and may not represent your situation.</li>
    <li>Research evolves, and findings can be <strong>mixed or contested</strong>; where that is the case, we try to say so.</li>
    <li>Statistics describe groups, not individuals. Being "typical" or "atypical" on any measure says nothing about your worth or your future.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>The assessment</h2>
  <p>
    The Context Assessment does not score, grade, or evaluate you. It places your
    answers next to population data and research. Its output is context, not a
    verdict, a diagnosis, or a recommendation. Decisions about your money, health,
    work, or relationships should be made with appropriate professional guidance,
    not on the basis of this tool.
  </p>

  <h2>No outcomes are promised</h2>
  <p>
    We make no claim that using this site will improve your life, change your
    circumstances, or produce any particular result. Seeing your situation clearly
    is valuable, but it is not a treatment and not a guarantee.
  </p>

  <h2>External links and advertising</h2>
  <p>
    The site links to external sources and services, and displays third-party
    advertising (including ads served through Google AdSense). We do not control and
    are not responsible for the content or practices of third-party sites or
    advertisers, and a link or ad is not an endorsement. We do not currently publish
    paid or affiliate reviews; where any commercial relationship ever affects
    content, we will disclose it clearly.
  </p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>
    Questions? Email <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>. See also our
    <a href="/terms">Terms of Use</a> and <a href="/privacy-policy">Privacy Policy</a>.
  </p>
</PageLayout>
